Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["LicDongleIncrementCounter", "ObjectName", 
      CellID -> 1538445559], Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], 
        Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"LicDongleIncrementCounter", "[", 
            RowBox[{StyleBox["handle", "TI"], ",", StyleBox["id", "TI"]}], 
            "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], " \[LineSeparator]increments the \
counter id by one and gives the new value."}], "Usage", CellID -> 64838897], 
     Cell["The increment is irreversible.", "Notes", CellID -> 1715052804], 
     Cell["The call needs the write role; elevate the session with \
LicDongleAuthorizeWrite.", "Notes", CellID -> 2133913788], 
     Cell["On failure the result is Failure[\"LicDongleError\", ...] with \
\"Status\" (the C status code), \"Operation\" and \"Detail\".", "Notes", 
      CellID -> 137871410]}, Open]], 
